OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'deeply caring'
OL,4,Adad killed in Swiss Alps plane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prominent Welsh businessman has been
OL,7,Fnamed as one of three people killed in
OL,8,Fa plane crash in the Swiss Alps.
OL,10,FOwain Davies, 55, from west Wales, was
OL,11,Fmanaging director of engineering firm
OL,12,FAmcanu, based in Burry Port,
OL,13,FCarmarthenshire.
OL,15,FHis son Aron Davies said the family had
OL,16,F"suffered an unimaginable loss",
OL,17,Fdescribing his father as "driven,
OL,18,Fdetermined and someone who simply
OL,19,Fdidn't accept that a problem was too
OL,20,Fbig to solve".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
